{"content_hash": "2aa5f0f8bd8b0fd6", "version_id": 804, "article_id": 81, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Farming Simulator 25 adds coffee and alpacas in South America DLC", "title_zh": "《模拟农场25》新DLC上线，去南美种咖啡养羊驼", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/articles/221607", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612287230202-1ff1d85d1bdf?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8ZGxjJTIwdmlkZW8lMjBnYW1lJTIwY29udHJvbGxlcnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkzMjM2MjEzfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Javier Martínez on Unsplash", "author": "Javier Martínez", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@cjdante?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/game-controller-in-neon-light-hUD0PUczwJQ?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(176, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(214, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "5ab094f0a0ba"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-29", "word_count": 285, "reading_minutes": 1.4, "lead": "Sega has released a paid expansion for Farming Simulator 25 that takes players to a new South American farm. The DLC, called Beans & Alpacas, adds coffee, bananas and alpacas, along with more than 25 new machines.", "lead_zh": "世嘉为《模拟农场25》推出了一款付费扩展包，带玩家走进全新的南美农场。这个DLC名为“Beans & Alpacas”，新增咖啡、香蕉和羊驼，还有25种以上的新农机。", "preview": "The expansion is available now on PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, PC through Steam, Epic Games Store and Windows, and Mac, and a launch trai", "preview_zh": "该扩展包现已登陆 PlayStation 5、Xbox Series X|S、PC（Steam、Epic Games Store 和 Windows）以及 Mac 平台，上线宣传片也已发布。玩家可以单独购买，也可以购买“Year 2 Season Pass”季票，比逐项购买付费内", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 784, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/81/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 102.425, "size_bytes": 615456, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 333, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/81/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 105.775, "size_bytes": 635616, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 333, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/81/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/81/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 113.125, "size_bytes": 679680, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 333, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/81/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/81/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 97.05, "size_bytes": 583200, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 333, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/81/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/81/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 103.3, "size_bytes": 620784, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 333, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/81/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@fec3522/content/data/versions/804.json", "paragraphs": ["The expansion is available now on PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, PC through Steam, Epic Games Store and Windows, and Mac, and a launch trailer has been published. It can be bought on its own or as part of the Year 2 Season Pass, which offers better value than buying each piece of paid content separately. A bundle edition that includes the base game and the DLC is also on sale.", "The new farm, Catuaí, is inspired by the coffee-growing regions of Brazil. It is a green, humid valley with red soil, dense vegetation and gentle hills, where narrow roads, dusty streets and scattered rocks shape the landscape. Players can explore the area, find dinosaur bones displayed in a local museum, or visit a research facility deep in the forest.", "Two new crops, coffee and bananas, come with fresh farming features. Coffee can be processed using drying and roasting facilities, while bananas can be moved on transport rails and washed with new equipment. Harvested crops can be turned into products such as tiramisu and banana chips, which gives players more ways to earn money from their land.", "Alpacas are the star of the new animals. Players can walk them to raise their happiness and shear them once a year; the wool can be sold directly or made into yarn, socks, pillows, furniture and alpaca toys. Brahman cattle have also been added, and wildlife such as parrots and harmless caimans make the surroundings feel more alive.", "More than 25 new machines and tools join the game, from brands including Case IH, Ford, John Deere, KUHN, Mercedes-Benz Trucks, New Holland, Oxbo, Stara and Valtra. Colombo Industries and Southern Spreaders appear in the series for the first time."], "paragraphs_zh": ["该扩展包现已登陆 PlayStation 5、Xbox Series X|S、PC（Steam、Epic Games Store 和 Windows）以及 Mac 平台，上线宣传片也已发布。玩家可以单独购买，也可以购买“Year 2 Season Pass”季票，比逐项购买付费内容更划算。包含游戏正篇和该 DLC 的捆绑版本也已同步发售。", "新农场“Catuaí”以巴西咖啡种植区为灵感。这里是一片湿润的绿色山谷，有红土、茂密植被和起伏平缓的丘陵，狭窄的道路、尘土飞扬的街道和散落的岩石构成了当地景观。玩家可以探索周边地区，在当地博物馆里看恐龙骨骼，或探访森林深处的研究设施。", "咖啡和香蕉两种新作物带来了新的种植玩法。咖啡可以使用干燥和烘焙设施加工，香蕉则可以用运输滑轨搬运，并用新设备清洗。收获的作物还能加工成提拉米苏、香蕉片等产品，让玩家有更多方式从土地中赚钱。", "羊驼是本次新动物的主角。玩家可以带它们散步提升幸福度，每年还能剪一次毛；羊驼毛既可直接出售，也能加工成毛线、袜子、枕头、家具和羊驼玩偶。游戏还新增了婆罗门牛，鹦鹉和不会咬人的凯门鳄等野生动物也让环境更有生气。", "游戏新增25种以上农机农具，来自 Case IH、Ford、John Deere、KUHN、Mercedes-Benz Trucks、New Holland、Oxbo、Stara 和 Valtra 等品牌。Colombo Industries 和 Southern Spreaders 首次加入该系列。游戏正篇已提供四种环境，以及来自150多个真实品牌的400多种农机。"], "body": "The expansion is available now on PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, PC through Steam, Epic Games Store and Windows, and Mac, and a launch trailer has been published. It can be bought on its own or as part of the Year 2 Season Pass, which offers better value than buying each piece of paid content separately. A bundle edition that includes the base game and the DLC is also on sale.\n\nThe new farm, Catuaí, is inspired by the coffee-growing regions of Brazil. It is a green, humid valley with red soil, dense vegetation and gentle hills, where narrow roads, dusty streets and scattered rocks shape the landscape. Players can explore the area, find dinosaur bones displayed in a local museum, or visit a research facility deep in the forest.\n\nTwo new crops, coffee and bananas, come with fresh farming features. Coffee can be processed using drying and roasting facilities, while bananas can be moved on transport rails and washed with new equipment. Harvested crops can be turned into products such as tiramisu and banana chips, which gives players more ways to earn money from their land.\n\nAlpacas are the star of the new animals. Players can walk them to raise their happiness and shear them once a year; the wool can be sold directly or made into yarn, socks, pillows, furniture and alpaca toys. Brahman cattle have also been added, and wildlife such as parrots and harmless caimans make the surroundings feel more alive.\n\nMore than 25 new machines and tools join the game, from brands including Case IH, Ford, John Deere, KUHN, Mercedes-Benz Trucks, New Holland, Oxbo, Stara and Valtra. Colombo Industries and Southern Spreaders appear in the series for the first time.", "body_zh": "该扩展包现已登陆 PlayStation 5、Xbox Series X|S、PC（Steam、Epic Games Store 和 Windows）以及 Mac 平台，上线宣传片也已发布。玩家可以单独购买，也可以购买“Year 2 Season Pass”季票，比逐项购买付费内容更划算。包含游戏正篇和该 DLC 的捆绑版本也已同步发售。\n\n新农场“Catuaí”以巴西咖啡种植区为灵感。这里是一片湿润的绿色山谷，有红土、茂密植被和起伏平缓的丘陵，狭窄的道路、尘土飞扬的街道和散落的岩石构成了当地景观。玩家可以探索周边地区，在当地博物馆里看恐龙骨骼，或探访森林深处的研究设施。\n\n咖啡和香蕉两种新作物带来了新的种植玩法。咖啡可以使用干燥和烘焙设施加工，香蕉则可以用运输滑轨搬运，并用新设备清洗。收获的作物还能加工成提拉米苏、香蕉片等产品，让玩家有更多方式从土地中赚钱。\n\n羊驼是本次新动物的主角。玩家可以带它们散步提升幸福度，每年还能剪一次毛；羊驼毛既可直接出售，也能加工成毛线、袜子、枕头、家具和羊驼玩偶。游戏还新增了婆罗门牛，鹦鹉和不会咬人的凯门鳄等野生动物也让环境更有生气。\n\n游戏新增25种以上农机农具，来自 Case IH、Ford、John Deere、KUHN、Mercedes-Benz Trucks、New Holland、Oxbo、Stara 和 Valtra 等品牌。Colombo Industries 和 Southern Spreaders 首次加入该系列。游戏正篇已提供四种环境，以及来自150多个真实品牌的400多种农机。", "text": "The expansion is available now on PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, PC through Steam, Epic Games Store and Windows, and Mac, and a launch trailer has been published. It can be bought on its own or as part of the Year 2 Season Pass, which offers better value than buying each piece of paid content separately. A bundle edition that includes the base game and the DLC is also on sale. The new farm, Catuaí, is inspired by the coffee-growing regions of Brazil. It is a green, humid valley with red soil, dense vegetation and gentle hills, where narrow roads, dusty streets and scattered rocks shape the landscape. Players can explore the area, find dinosaur bones displayed in a local museum, or visit a research facility deep in the forest. Two new crops, coffee and bananas, come with fresh farming features. Coffee can be processed using drying and roasting facilities, while bananas can be moved on transport rails and washed with new equipment. Harvested crops can be turned into products such as tiramisu and banana chips, which gives players more ways to earn money from their land. Alpacas are the star of the new animals. Players can walk them to raise their happiness and shear them once a year; the wool can be sold directly or made into yarn, socks, pillows, furniture and alpaca toys. Brahman cattle have also been added, and wildlife such as parrots and harmless caimans make the surroundings feel more alive. More than 25 new machines and tools join the game, from brands including Case IH, Ford, John Deere, KUHN, Mercedes-Benz Trucks, New Holland, Oxbo, Stara and Valtra. Colombo Industries and Southern Spreaders appear in the series for the first time.", "vocab": [{"word": "expansion", "pos": "noun", "zh": "扩展包", "note": "游戏术语，指追加内容", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "launch trailer", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "上线宣传片", "note": "游戏发布时的预告视频", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "bundle", "pos": "noun", "zh": "捆绑包", "note": "把多个内容打包出售", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "inspired by", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "以……为灵感", "note": "常用被动结构", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "dense", "pos": "adj", "zh": "茂密的", "note": "常形容植被、森林", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "scattered", "pos": "adj", "zh": "零散分布的", "note": "scatter 的过去分词作形容词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "harvest", "pos": "verb", "zh": "收获", "note": "也可作名词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "shear", "pos": "verb", "zh": "剪（羊毛）", "note": "过去式 sheared", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "livestock", "pos": "noun", "zh": "牲畜", "note": "不可数名词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "wildlife", "pos": "noun", "zh": "野生动物", "note": "不可数名词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "for the first time", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "首次", "note": "常与现在完成时连用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "value", "pos": "noun", "zh": "划算程度；价值", "note": "better value 意为更划算", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-29T01:10:10.588590", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.375, "sm": 250, "em": 375, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "expansion", "s": 0.375, "e": 1.0, "sm": 375, "em": 1000, "cs": 4, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "is", "s": 1.0, "e": 1.125, "sm": 1000, "em": 1125, "cs": 14, "ce": 16, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "available", "s": 1.125, "e": 1.625, "sm": 1125, "em": 1625, "cs": 17, "ce": 26, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "now", "s": 1.625, "e": 1.875, "sm": 1625, "em": 1875, "cs": 27, "ce": 30, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "on", "s": 1.875, "e": 2.025, "sm": 1875, "em": 2024, "cs": 31, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "PlayStation", "s": 2.025, "e": 2.638, "sm": 2025, "em": 2637, "cs": 34, "ce": 45, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "5", "s": 2.638, "e": 3.225, "sm": 2637, "em": 3224,